{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Fold space to cheat your way through puzzles.</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664840/extras/2064a043ea5ccd13d8d32d6c0780c9a3.poster.avif?t=1770743586\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664840/extras/2064a043ea5ccd13d8d32d6c0780c9a3.webm?t=1770743586\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664840/extras/2064a043ea5ccd13d8d32d6c0780c9a3.mp4?t=1770743586\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Reshape geometry. Rewrite Reality.</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Discover a variety of gameplay mechanics and break them in delightful ways with space folding.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664840/extras/0a2d7506b730477e05d97cb4c68914d7.poster.avif?t=1770743586\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664840/extras/0a2d7506b730477e05d97cb4c68914d7.webm?t=1770743586\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664840/extras/0a2d7506b730477e05d97cb4c68914d7.mp4?t=1770743586\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Every puzzle is a star in the sky</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master space manipulation to reach beyond the stars.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664840/extras/